cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "EPOCH — the population–output elasticity"
message: "If you use this software or the archived results, please cite the paper below."
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/denovo2021/EPOCH"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, input data and result artifacts for a hierarchical Bayesian
  estimate of the elasticity of aggregate real output with respect to
  population, and its propagation through United Nations medium-variant
  demography to 2100 for 175 economies.
keywords:
  - depopulation
  - population–output elasticity
  - hierarchical Bayesian model
  - economic projection
  - population ageing
